{"2723540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bully Ball Soccer", "steam_appid": 2723540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>⚽ BullyBallSoccer 3rd Anniversary</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To celebrate BullyBallSoccer's third anniversary, the original 2023 version of the game is now available as a public beta branch. If you'd like to revisit the first release and see how the game has evolved, feel free to give it a try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, in a surprising turn of events, I've finally launched an official Discord server. Feel free to join, discuss the game, find teammates (with a bit of luck!), and help build the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to access the original 2023 version:</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click BullyBallSoccer in your Steam Library, select <strong>Properties</strong>, open the <strong>Betas</strong> tab, and opt into the <strong>originalbullyballsoccer_2023</strong> branch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723540/extras/95951ed6340d0a8dd52bc4dfea225d4b.avif?t=1781128241\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723540/extras/125d17e505c305c38cd90f0764577ebd.avif?t=1781128241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723540/extras_big/125d17e505c305c38cd90f0764577ebd.avif?t=1781128241 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723540/extras/d091bc155ec64665430c748a1cb6ac38.avif?t=1781128241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723540/extras_big/d091bc155ec64665430c748a1cb6ac38.avif?t=1781128241 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723540/extras/d2f301babb912ea797d7da35929a5bec.avif?t=1781128241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723540/extras_big/d2f301babb912ea797d7da35929a5bec.avif?t=1781128241 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723540/extras/764e1b8fa937241a8f1e26d483a5765a.avif?t=1781128241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723540/extras_big/764e1b8fa937241a8f1e26d483a5765a.avif?t=1781128241 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>A minimalist, multiplayer game where you are Bully, the only soccer-playing ball with special abilities. Host or join sessions for quick, laid-back matches with friends or strangers. Roll, jump, fly, and dash your way to victory in this simple physics based soccer extravaganza.", "about_the_game": "A minimalist, multiplayer game where you are Bully, the only soccer-playing ball with special abilities. Host or join sessions for quick, laid-back matches with friends or strangers. Roll, jump, fly, and dash your way to victory in this simple physics based soccer extravaganza.", "short_description": "A minimalist, multiplayer game where you are Bully, the only ball in the world who can play soccer. Host or join sessions for quick, laid-back matches with friends or strangers. Roll, jump, fly, and dash your way to victory in this simple physics based soccer extravaganza. (Good connection required)", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723540/e5a16089c88a8861f5